1
00:00:00,918 --> 00:00:03,918
(Sheldon:)My queen can now
take your rook from below.

2
00:00:04,722 --> 00:00:07,832
(Penny:)So that means I lose, right?
It's over!

3
00:00:09,027 --> 00:00:11,237
(Sheldon:)If I make this move...

4
00:00:11,896 --> 00:00:14,506
(Sheldon:)But I won't because
we're having too much fun.

5
00:00:16,868 --> 00:00:21,178
(Penny:)-Okay, let's take a break.
-We're all out of alcohol.

6
00:00:21,339 --> 00:00:22,909
(Penny:)I wasn't going to get alcohol.

7
00:00:30,014 --> 00:00:33,364
(Penny:)Gosh, I wonder what Leonard's doing
right now. I miss him so much.

8
00:00:33,518 --> 00:00:36,898
(Sheldon:)Well, if you'd like,
we could call him.

9
00:00:37,055 --> 00:00:38,555
(Sheldon:)I mean that you could call him.

10
00:00:38,723 --> 00:00:42,463
(Sheldon:)As I've explained, the absence
of my friends does not cause me pain.

11
00:00:42,627 --> 00:00:44,627
(Sheldon:)As rock and roll bad boy Paul Simon
once said,

12
00:00:44,796 --> 00:00:48,746
"I am a rock. I am an iiiisland."

13
00:00:50,101 --> 00:00:52,411
(Penny:)-I'm calling him.
-Oh, goodie! Put him on speakerphone!

14
00:00:54,272 --> 00:01:01,022
I (DANCE MUSIC PLAYS) I

